OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785264513
OL,3,CMan charged with the murder of Denis
OL,4,CDonaldson remanded in custody
OL,6,FA man charged with the 2006 murder of
OL,7,FBritish spy Denis Donaldson has been
OL,8,Fremanded in custody ahead of what is
OL,9,Fexpected to be an application for bail.
OL,11,FAntoin Duffy, in his 40s, of no fixed
OL,12,Faddress, appeared before the non-jury
OL,13,FSpecial Criminal Court on Monday.
OL,15,FHe is charged with the murder of Mr
OL,16,FDonaldson in Cloghercor, Doochary, Co
OL,17,FDonegal, between April 3 and 4 2006
OL,18,Fafter being extradited from Scotland
OL,19,Fearlier this year.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
