PN,41702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785264513
OL,3,CMan charged with the murder of Denis
OL,4,CDonaldson remanded in custody
OL,6,FHe was also charged with possession of
OL,7,Fa shotgun and ammunition "with intent
OL,8,Fto endanger life" at the same date and
OL,9,Flocation.
OL,11,FHe was also charged with the attempted
OL,12,Fmurder of a second man, Liam Copeland
OL,13,FMcGinley, at Meenaboll in Co Donegal
OL,14,Fon November 19 2007, and also charged
OL,15,Fwith possession of a shotgun and
OL,16,Fpossession of ammunition on the same
OL,17,Fdate.
