PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785264513
OL,3,CMan charged with the murder of Denis
OL,4,CDonaldson remanded in custody
OL,6,FMr Donaldson, 55, was shot dead at a
OL,7,Fremote cottage near Glentie, months
OL,8,Fafter he was exposed as a paid agent
OL,9,Ffor Special Branch and MI5 since the
OL,10,F1980s.
OL,12,FIn 2009, dissident republican group
OL,13,Fthe Real IRA claimed the killing.JMr
OL,14,FDonaldson was also a former
OL,15,Fadministrator for Sinn Fein's Stormont
OL,16,FAssembly team.
OL,26,@wD@Yrr
