PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785264513
OL,3,CMan charged with the murder of Denis
OL,4,CDonaldson remanded in custody
OL,6,FAppearing before the non-jury court on
OL,7,FMonday, a barrister representing Mr
OL,8,FDuffy said he was "somewhat concerned"
OL,9,Fthat the book of evidence in relation
OL,10,Fto the 2006 murder charge had not yet
OL,11,Fbeen served.
OL,13,FHe said this was the third time they
OL,14,Fwere before the court for the serving
OL,15,Fof the book of evidence.
OL,17,FHe said a pending bail application had
OL,18,Fbeen delayed because the second book
OL,19,Fof evidence had not yet been served.
OL,26,@pD@SOUpD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
