PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785264513
OL,3,CMan charged with the murder of Denis
OL,4,CDonaldson remanded in custody
OL,6,FHe said the bail objections they had
OL,7,Freceived to date were "scant" and said
OL,8,Fthey were "in the dark" which was
OL,9,F"concerning at this stage".
OL,11,FThe prosecuting barrister said that
OL,12,Fthe second book of evidence was to be
OL,13,Fserved in October, and said the case
OL,14,Fdates back "some time" which requires
OL,15,F"significant" investigative work.
OL,17,FThe matter was put back until October
OL,18,F12 for the second book of evidence to
OL,19,Fbe served by then or "at least on that
OL,20,Fdate, at the latest", Mr Justice
OL,21,FPatrick McGrath said.
